<title>UK: DNIB sets 3.0 bln Lux franc step-up ten-year bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 3.0 bln Lux franc step-up ten-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Europeen and Banque Bruxelles Lambert SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON    *5.75	MATURITY    29.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE 19/20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.07 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS STEPPING UP TO 6.75 PERCENT</p>
<p>		FOR NEXT THREE YEARS, THEN 8.50 PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50-250    LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   DUTCH/LUX  MGT/UND    1.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	LONG FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
